<main id="home"><section class="hero wrap"><div class="hero-copy"><div class="eyebrow">DevOps · Cloud · Automation</div><h1>Tejas Sushanth <span>H V.</span></h1><p>I’m building my path into DevOps and Cloud Engineering through hands-on practice, automation, and real deployment projects. I enjoy turning repeatable manual steps into reliable workflows.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="#projects">Explore my projects ↗</a><a class="btn btn-quiet" href="assets/Tejas-Sushanth-HV-Resume.txt" download>↓ Download resume</a></div><div class="status"><span class="dot"></span> Open to entry-level DevOps / Cloud opportunities</div><p class="micro">Currently focusing on Linux · Git · Docker · Jenkins · CI/CD</p></div>
<div class="visual" aria-label="Animated 3D DevOps illustration"><div class="orbital"><div class="core"><strong>THV</strong></div><div class="float-chip chip-a">&lt; CI / CD &gt;</div><div class="float-chip chip-b">☁ Cloud</div><div class="float-chip chip-c">$ automate.sh</div></div></div></section>
